import lemmas.Compiler.CompRunHintPI

/-!
# The hint cases of `+run`: the kept static tag (README Gaps 25)

`[11 tag q]` with `tag` `hint-static` (`%bout`, `%xray`): `+simple-next`,
`+past-if` over `q`, the epilogue `[%hse tag body]`, `q` under `%next` to
it, `+lazy-bound`, the prologue `[%hsp tag body]`, the result `[%next laz ~
prol]`.  The branch `cr11Kept` is cut at its pushes (`ckHead`, `ckP1` from
`+past-if`, `ckP3` from the run of `q`; `tools/gen/runhintk.py`).

* `cr11_kept`: `crK11` on a static tag is `cr11Kept`.
* `ck_p3`, `ck_p1`: the parts, against any model `R` of `q`.
* **`comp_run_n11s_kept`**: the case on every goal against `runLCH env snd
  true msup`, from `SoundAt` of `q` and the link of `q` at the goal it
  gets.
-/

